+// Whether this is the first start of 1.x on a profile last opened by 0.x
+// (`last`: the version that last opened it, "" before Meridian kept it, when
+// `onboarded` tells an old profile from a new one). 0.x was signed by
+// Meridian itself, 1.x with Apple's Developer ID: macOS asks once more about
+// the "Meridian Safe Storage" keychain item, and keeps asking at every start
+// until Always Allow.
+bool FirstStartAfterZeroX(std::string_view last,
+                          bool onboarded,
+                          std::string_view current);
+
 // What a release offers this Mac: the zip the updater swaps in, the
